			"notes": "## 0.6.0\n\n- Added a native e4BTA page to BTA's in game Options menu.\n- Added settings for automatic hosting, the default host port, lobby access, and whether e4BTA should start Steam when needed.\n- Added e4BTA Voice integration. When the addon is installed, its toggle and hotkeys appear on the e4BTA page.\n- Registered e4BTA language resources through HalpLibe so option names render correctly."
		},
