			"notes": "## e4BTA 0.4.0\n\n### Changes since 0.3.0 Beta 3\n\n- Server entries now use the host’s Steam display name.\n- Added automatic background server discovery.\n- Added a 30 second startup grace period while Steam opens and initializes.\n- Added automatic discovery retries instead of immediately showing an error.\n- Added alphabetical host sorting.\n- Added custom e4BTA and Steam icons.\n- Improved connection progress messages.\n- Steam can now be opened automatically on Windows when needed.\n- Fixed the Steam Friends page name, translation warning, and incorrect outdated server indicator."
		},
