			"notes": "## e4BTA 0.3.0 Beta 3\n\ne4BTA allows Better than Adventure! players to host and join multiplayer servers through Steam Networking Messages using Spacewar (App ID 480), without router port forwarding.\n\n### New\n\n- Added a Steam Friends server browser to BTA's multiplayer menu.\n- Added Steam avatars to discovered server entries.\n- Added automatic background server discovery and refresh.\n- Added loading, empty, and discovery-error states.\n- Added server name, MOTD, version, protocol, and player-count information.\n- Added connection progress messages.\n- Added a Reconnect button for the last Steam server.\n- Added Copy Diagnostics for easier troubleshooting.\n- Steam friends can join friends-only servers without receiving an invitation.\n- Direct `.steam` addresses remain available as a fallback.\n\n### Requirements\n\n- Better than Adventure! 8.0.1\n- Fabric Loader 0.18.4-bta.11\n- Steam running and online\n- Spacewar/App ID 480 available\n- Both the server and clients must have the same e4BTA version\n\n### Notes\n\nThis is a beta release. Please report connection failures with logs and the copied diagnostics report if possible."
		},
